    "n1": {
      "text": "One page: tap Use my current location and the map jumps to where you are (no dragging, no pin to move). Check the area and region, pick how you receive it, add your phone, Save. The map is the app's own map and shows only when the admin turns it on (third board: off). Pickup stays empty until an admin adds pickup points. Fourth board: KiyuMart's own riders switched on.",
      "w": 240,
      "x": -259,
      "y": -151
    },
    "n2": {
      "text": "Checkout shows the saved delivery details with Change. Pay is off until details are added. The customer pays the delivery fee: we send the amount before dispatch and it is paid outside the app. Track order follows each shop's parcel.",
